'PROPOSED RESTRUCTURE (Oct 6 night, after the Dartee call). Not applied. Five decisions below.

WHAT DARTEE TAUGHT US THAT APPLIES TO LUCKY
1. Start the giveaway NOW, not Oct 29. Dartee launches Oct 9 and runs 38 days. Lucky''s plan launches Oct 29 and runs 18, which buys about 5,000 leads at $3; starting Oct 15 buys 8,000 to 10,000 for the same daily budget.
2. One prize that is unmistakable in six words. Dartee: "every single belt to your foursome". Lucky: "we outfit your whole foursome, every club we make".
3. A light warm-up offer, then a signup-only week, then 48 hours of early access for the list, then the public launch on Thanksgiving. Lucky''s current plan has no warm-up offer and a one-day members window; the two-day window and the signup-only week are what make the list worth joining.
4. Early Bird at Dartee is BOGO 50 because they have history and margin to give. Lucky''s rule is no markdown, so Lucky''s warm-up is the gift: a free hat with any club.
5. A new product on Cyber Monday is the reason to come back (Dartee: the Lizard belt). Lucky has three launches to place: putters, driver, irons.

THE PROPOSED SEASON
Oct 15 to Nov 16: THE GIVEAWAY. We outfit your whole foursome: all four of you get both Carvers (the three-wedge set), an Eclipse putter, the Stryker, a polo and a hat, and the Havoc driver the day it drops. About $4,500 of golf; it costs Lucky about $850. Enter free, email + phone. Goal 8,000 to 10,000 entries, $20k to $30k, $2.50 to $3 a lead.
Nov 1 to 16: EARLY BIRD. Free hat with any club. The warm-up, lighter than the weekend. (Decision 3: yes or no.)
Nov 17 to 23: SIGNUP WEEK. No offer promoted; the Eclipse Black putters launch Thu Nov 19 (members first) and the only ask is "join the list for 48 hours of early access". Tell them the real offer.
Tue Nov 24 to Wed Nov 25: EARLY ACCESS, 48 HOURS, list only. The full Black Friday offer two days early AND the Havoc driver on sale to the list before anyone else. (Decision 4: does the list get the driver Tuesday, or does it wait for the public reveal Thursday?)
Thu Nov 26 (Thanksgiving) to Mon Nov 30: BLACK FRIDAY. Buy any 2 clubs, get a Carver 02 Gold free (driver counts). Free hat with every club. First 400 orders get a polo. Havoc driver at full price, name revealed to the public Thursday 8am CT. Store open to everyone, members-only link no longer needed.
Mon Nov 30 to Fri Dec 4: CYBER MONDAY. Same offer, plus the reason to come back: THE IRONS OPEN FOR PRE-ORDER, first 200 sets, ship in January, full price. (Decision 5.) Glove in every order Monday.
Dec 4 to 16: apparel drop (members Dec 3), driver as the gift, order by Dec 13 standard / Dec 16 expedited.
Dec 17 to 24: gift cards. Buy a $100 card, get a free hat (the no-markdown version of Dartee''s matched cards).
Dec 26 to 31: run the bundle back to entrants who did not buy.
Jan 6 to 12: THE FULL BAG. Irons ship, the full-bag story (driver, irons, putter, wedges), fitting content.

THE LEAD MATH (Scenarios tab, saved as "Lucky Bag giveaway")
$25k at $3 a lead = 8,300 leads. If 8% buy at $150 that is 670 orders and about $100k back across the weekend and December, a 4x on the lead spend and about $30k left after it on a 55% margin. Breakeven cost per lead at 8% is $6.60; to hit 3x pay no more than $4. KPI for the giveaway: under $3 a lead, 8,000 entries by Nov 16, 8% of them buying by Dec 31 (tracked as a Klaviyo segment, same as Dartee).

THE FIVE DECISIONS
1. Giveaway start: Oct 15 (recommended) or Oct 29 as planned. Oct 15 means the page, the prize photo and the first ads by Oct 14.
2. The prize: the whole foursome outfitted (3 wedges + putter + Stryker + polo + hat each) plus a Havoc driver each when it drops. Irons stay OUT of the prize and out of November; they are January''s event.
3. Early Bird Nov 1 to 16: free hat with any club, yes or no. (No = November is the giveaway and the putter launch only, as locked today.)
4. Early access: 48 hours Tue Nov 24 to Wed Nov 25 for the list (replaces the one-day Thursday members window), and whether the list gets the Havoc driver Tuesday or everyone waits for Thursday.
5. Irons: pre-order opens Cyber Monday and ships January (recommended), or sell them on Black Friday with the driver, or hold everything to January.

